# TodoMVC Architecture Plan

## Stack
- **Backend**: Rust, Axum 0.8, SQLite via sqlx, tower-http (CORS + static files)
- **Frontend**: Rust/WASM, Leptos 0.8, gloo-net for HTTP, Trunk for build
- **Shared**: `types` crate for Todo struct used by both sides

## Workspace Layout
```
Cargo.toml              # workspace root: members = [backend, frontend, types]
types/
  Cargo.toml
  src/lib.rs            # Todo, CreateTodo, UpdateTodo structs (serde)
backend/
  Cargo.toml
  migrations/
    YYYYMMDD_create_todos.sql
  src/
    main.rs             # server startup, router assembly, CORS, static files
    db.rs               # SQLite pool init, embedded migrations
    routes.rs           # Axum router definition
    handlers.rs         # handler functions for all endpoints
  tests/
    api_tests.rs        # integration tests
frontend/
  Cargo.toml
  Trunk.toml            # proxy /api to backend
  index.html            # WASM entry point + TodoMVC CSS
  style.css             # TodoMVC stylesheet
  src/
    main.rs             # Leptos mount
    app.rs              # TodoApp root component, toggle-all
    api.rs              # HTTP client (gloo-net)
    components/
      mod.rs
      todo_item.rs      # display, toggle, delete, inline edit
      todo_footer.rs    # count, filters, clear completed
```

## Shared Types (types crate)
```rust
struct Todo { id: i64, title: String, completed: bool, order: i64 }
struct CreateTodo { title: String }
struct UpdateTodo { title: Option<String>, completed: Option<bool>, order: Option<i64> }
```

## API Endpoints
| Method | Path                     | Purpose              |
|--------|--------------------------|----------------------|
| GET    | /api/todos               | List all             |
| POST   | /api/todos               | Create               |
| GET    | /api/todos/:id           | Get one              |
| PATCH  | /api/todos/:id           | Update one           |
| DELETE | /api/todos/:id           | Delete one           |
| PATCH  | /api/todos               | Toggle all           |
| DELETE | /api/todos/completed     | Clear completed      |

## Database Schema
```sql
CREATE TABLE todos (
  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT,
  title TEXT NOT NULL,
  completed BOOLEAN NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,
  "order" INTEGER NOT NULL DEFAULT 0
);
```

## Issue Dependency Graph
```
Issue 1 (workspace init)
  ├── Issue 2 (SQLite + migrations)
  │     ├── Issue 4 (CRUD endpoints)
  │     │     ├── Issue 5 (bulk ops)
  │     │     └── Issue 6 (CORS + static)
  │     └── Issue 13 (integration tests) [depends on 4+5]
  ├── Issue 3 (Trunk + frontend entry)
  │     ├── Issue 7 (API client) [also needs types from 1]
  │     │     ├── Issue 8 (TodoApp root)
  │     │     │     ├── Issue 9 (TodoItem)
  │     │     │     │     └── Issue 10 (inline edit)
  │     │     │     ├── Issue 11 (TodoFooter)
  │     │     │     └── Issue 12 (toggle-all)
  └── Issue 14 (README) [last]
```

## Key Design Decisions
1. **Shared types crate** avoids duplicating Todo struct between backend/frontend
2. **SQLite** — lightweight, no external DB needed; sqlx compile-time checked queries
3. **Trunk proxy** — frontend dev server proxies /api to backend, avoiding CORS in dev
4. **Client-side filtering** — All/Active/Completed filters use URL hash, no server round-trip
5. **Leptos signals** — single `Vec<Todo>` signal in TodoApp, passed to children
6. **gloo-net** for WASM-compatible HTTP client (reqwest WASM target also viable)
